{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hyaOGcpuNaVubTLwEHJ0vA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:34.638114+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hyaOGcpuNaVubTLwEHJ0vA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/blk2okRJ7SRn4zGuDG5Zf28R2tqOrWv1SAhkI8DIpGPDkAb5TsTZibpju4ia8MFlQsibGQcbGDPzDAFn9HiaxCAesQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>为加强高校间优秀大学生的沟通和交流，增进优秀大学生对南方科技大学（简称“南科大”）地球与空间科学系（简称“地空系”）的了解，同时选拔有培养潜质的优秀学生攻读研究生，南科大地空系拟于2025年7月1日-7月4日举办夏令营活动，对2026级推免硕士生和直博生进行提前选拔。南科大将为录取的优秀学子提供丰厚的奖助学金和一流的科研条件，欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、报名对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、全国高校本科三年级在校生（2026届本科毕业生）</span></p><p><span>2、成果突出的优秀往届本科生和应往届硕士生</span></p><p><span>3、成绩优秀，英语水平良好</span></p><p><span>4、科研兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力</span></p><p><span>5、身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、拟招收专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、学硕：070800 地球物理学</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、专硕：085700资源与环境</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、活动时间：2025年7月2日-3日（7月1日营员报道，7月4日离营）</span></span></p><p><span>2、活动安排：线下进行，包括开营仪式、师生互动、推免生面试、实验室及校园参观、导师face time等。</span></p><p><span>3、活动费用：届时南科大地空系将为异地学校营员提供夏令营期间在深圳的免费食宿，并给予来程路费补贴。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿，仅提供免费用餐。</span></p><p><strong><span>*</span><em><span>活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></em></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>【网上申报】</span></span></strong></p><p><span>请于报名时间截止前，登录南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统：</span><em><span><span>https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/</span></span></em><span><span>，推荐使用 chrome、360 浏览器，点击“全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行在线报名。申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息。需填报不超过2个意向报考导师并上传以下证明材料：</span></span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件（在校生提供）或毕业证书与学位证书复印件（往届生提供）</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务公章，硕士生需同时提交本科成绩单），成绩单上注明所在专业的成绩排名</span></p><p><span>（4）介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内。</span></p><p><span>（5）副教授以上专家书面推荐信2份（格式不限，硕士生必须提交，本科学生自愿提交）</span></p><p><span>（6）其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。另请申请者将南方科技大学2025年夏令营申请表（报名系统生成打印签字）和全部证明材料合并成一个pdf文件，发送至：</span></p><p><span>essyzb@sustech.edu.cn，邮件主题及附件标明“夏令营+姓名+学校+专业”。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>*招生导师及研究方向见系官网：</span></strong></p><p><em><span>http://ess.sustech.edu.cn/Case-index.html。</span></em><strong><span><span>点击文末“阅读原文”跳转至系官网。</span></span></strong><span>（建议提前联系意向导师）</span></p><p><strong><span>网上申请截止日期：2025年6月18日23:59</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>提醒：</span></strong><span>入营报到时请携带有效的本人身份证和学生证进行资格审查，并按顺序提交身份证复印件、学生证复印件，所有文件原件请一并携带备查，其他证明材料可提供复印件。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>此外，请大家继续关注自己在报名系统中填写的邮箱。申请截止后，夏令营评审工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审者将以电子邮件的形式通知公布。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、材料审核及入选通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请截止后，夏令营评审工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将以电子邮件（系统填写的邮箱）的形式通知，敬请留意查看。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、活动咨询</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>有关夏令营的活动咨询，请优先以“夏令营咨询”为邮件主题发送给essyzb@sustech.edu.cn。或致电：0755-88015513陈老师</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>或加入地空系夏令营官方QQ群：424853849（备注姓名-学校）</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/u4bwBBDvGdrg8pwZkdZxU01kvz7f02aicSRbqFAZFf2ozgQib0oR5Tpth74SCeicQW7TsPfXiciaYjS12R1Ts0OvVUA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>地球与空间科学系</span></b></p></section><section><section><p><span> Department of Earth and Space Sciences</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>南方科技大学地球与空间科学系成立于2017年1月，由中国科学院院士陈晓非教授担任首届系主任。</span></p><p><span><span>本系建系宗旨是：建设国际化的、一流的地球与空间科学人才培养与科研基地，以促进人类对地球及其所处空间这一复杂自然系统运动规律的探索和认知，为应对当前人类社会发展中所面临的来自于自然环境、资源与灾害方面的严峻挑战以及开展行星际空间探索提供科学基础，并培养具有足够能力解决未来地球与空间科学领域科学问题的学术领军人才与管理人才。</span></span></p><p><span><span>南方科技大学地球与空间科学系在以下几个研究方向上开展学术研究与人才培养：地球内部物理和动力学、应用地球物理学和空间物理和行星科学。目前，本系已有教研人员31人，包括讲席教授4人，教授5人，副教授17人，助理教授5人；其中包括中国科学院院士1人，国家级领军专家6人，国家级青年专家16人。我们期待更多的优秀人才加盟，共建世界一流地球与空间科学人才培养和科学研究基地。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/u4bwBBDvGdrg8pwZkdZxU01kvz7f02aic2oHA1ZH4bsr4KnGIwnyEcOdyK7TBFwGvAch9oIKbf7Wk3rCbRvqicCw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span>期待这个暑期</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>与闪闪发光的你</span></p><p><span>在夏日的校园里相见！</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>推荐阅读</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzU0ODU3NDE1OQ==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4003628796032008210&amp;subscene=159&amp;subscene=&amp;scenenote=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FsH7BugiuUr1DgUY_o6euww&amp;nolastread=1#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzU0ODU3NDE1OQ==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=4003628796032008210&amp;subscene=159&amp;subscene=&amp;scenenote=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FsH7BugiuUr1DgUY_o6euww&amp;nolastread=1#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/u4bwBBDvGdrg8pwZkdZxU01kvz7f02aicFzxiacHnkTchfuAial04EZ8KWPXBco47T0r6NvGKXsiaA8RRCPiarSkjnQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></a></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>--- 南方科技大学 ---</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>地球与空间科学系</span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"485411b71e783dcfe494132bb8eaaa63343e8ecfc2ac1258bca02cde7e674304","textLength":1998,"sourceSha256":"1f31a62d9a18579dd49aa72a7b100